abstract: >-
  Moment and prime-trace criteria for the Riemann hypothesis, compact-elliptic
  and regular boundary-power exclusions, the full constant-coefficient Morse
  exclusion, and continuous-kernel and nonlocal positivity formulations.
  Conditional TCGS–SEQUENTION source-to-readout identifications are explicitly
  separated from the analytic results. The Riemann hypothesis is not proved.
